{"4724610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zero Hour Night", "steam_appid": 4724610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where the sun will never rise again. In Zero Hour: Night, you are one of the few survivors in an urban wasteland occupied by ruthless, autonomous machines. Darkness is no longer just your surroundings—it is your constant companion and your greatest enemy. After the world plunged into eternal shadow, robots seized control. Your mission is as simple as it is deadly: scavenge the ruins for vital resources, find valuable components, and use a workbench to arm yourself against the constant threat.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where the sun will never rise again. In Zero Hour: Night, you are one of the few survivors in an urban wasteland occupied by ruthless, autonomous machines. Darkness is no longer just your surroundings—it is your constant companion and your greatest enemy. After the world plunged into eternal shadow, robots seized control. Your mission is as simple as it is deadly: scavenge the ruins for vital resources, find valuable components, and use a workbench to arm yourself against the constant threat.</p>", "short_description": "The sun has gone out the world belongs to the machines. In ZHN, you fight for survival in eternal darkness. Scavenge ruins, put every screw to use at your workbench, and stay in the shadows because the robots hunt anything that emits light. Do you have what it takes to survive the apocalypse?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4724610/78835e0887f746f571e3bacf252bc26a58db204b/header.jpg?t=1785508881", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic